{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Come, let me advise you.</b> Moses our teacher stated the advice in obscured form, because Balaam said it to Balak in secret; but in the section of Midian it is revealed, as it is written: ״החייתם כל נקבה״ etc., ״הן הנה היו לבני ישראל בדבר בלעם״ etc." "<b>What this people will do to your people.</b> That will be in the end of days, as he goes on to explain: ״אראנו ולא עתה״ etc. If you join them now in the matter of this counsel, you have nothing to fear from them."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:34.025722739Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}